### 6.3 `app.js` — Statistical Engine & UI Controller (1267 lines)

The entire application is a single `DOMContentLoaded` IIFE. Below are all major function
groups with their purpose and internal logic.

#### Application State Variables
| Variable           | Type     | Purpose                                          |
|--------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `rawData`          | Array    | Full unfiltered dataset (loaded from TIPS_DATA[]) |
| `activeData`       | Array    | Currently filtered subset of rawData              |
| `currentFilter`    | Object   | `{day, time, smoker}` — active filter state       |
| `currentPage`      | Number   | Current page in the paginated raw data table      |
| `rowsPerPage`      | Constant | 10 rows per page                                  |
| `sortColumn`       | String   | Active sort key for raw table                     |
| `sortAsc`          | Boolean  | Sort direction flag                               |
| `chartInstances`   | Object   | Cache of Chart.js instances (to destroy/re-render)|

#### Statistical Core Functions (all implemented from scratch)
| Function                | Formula / Logic                                                  |
|-------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `mean(arr)`             | `Σxᵢ / n` — array reduce sum divided by length                  |
| `median(arr)`           | Sort array; take middle element or average of two middle elements |
| `mode(arr)`             | Frequency map on values rounded to 2 decimal places; most frequent |
| `quantile(arr, q)`      | Linear interpolation between sorted array elements               |
| `variance(arr)`         | Sample variance: `Σ(xᵢ - x̄)² / (n-1)` (Bessel's correction)    |
| `stdDev(arr)`           | `Math.sqrt(variance(arr))`                                       |
| `iqr(arr)`              | `quantile(arr, 0.75) - quantile(arr, 0.25)`                      |
| `pearsonR(xArr, yArr)`  | `Σ[(xᵢ-x̄)(yᵢ-ȳ)] / sqrt[Σ(xᵢ-x̄)² · Σ(yᵢ-ȳ)²]`              |
| `linearRegression(x,y)` | OLS slope `m = r · (sy/sx)`, intercept `b = ȳ - m·x̄`           |
| `formatMoney(amount)`   | Indian locale formatting: `₹1,642.23` using `toLocaleString('en-IN')` |

#### UI Controller Functions
| Function                    | Trigger               | Action                                              |
|-----------------------------|-----------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
| `applyFilters()`            | Dropdown change       | Filters `rawData` into `activeData`, calls `updateDashboard()` |
| `updateDashboard()`         | Any data change       | Orchestrator — calls all 6 update + render functions |
| `updateKPIs()`              | `updateDashboard()`   | Writes mean, median, IQR, P(Sat), Pearson r to KPI ribbon |
| `updateCentralTendency()`   | `updateDashboard()`   | Writes mean/median/mode/range/Q1/Q3/IQR/StdDev/CV for all 3 numeric vars |
| `updateDayVariabilityTable()` | `updateDashboard()` | Computes and injects rows for day-wise stats table  |
| `updateOutlierAnalysis()`   | `updateDashboard()`   | Computes Tukey fences, flags outliers, renders chips and table |
| `updateProbabilityLab()`    | `updateDashboard()` + slider | Computes P(Bill > threshold), P(Tip > threshold), and conditional probability |
| `renderRawTable()`          | `updateDashboard()` + search/sort/page | Renders paginated, sorted, searched raw data table |
| `renderAllCharts()`         | Tab 4 activation + theme toggle | Destroys and re-renders all 7 Chart.js charts |
| `generateBusinessReport()`  | `updateDashboard()`   | Computes KPIs, builds AI prompt, calls `fetchAIReport()` |
| `fetchAIReport(prompt)`     | `generateBusinessReport()` | Tries Gemini → OpenRouter → Groq in sequence; injects HTML result |
| `syncSliderBounds()`        | Boot                  | Sets Probability Lab slider min/max/step/value     |

#### Event Listeners
| Element                   | Event     | Handler                          |
|---------------------------|-----------|----------------------------------|
| `#uploadCsvBtn`           | click     | Triggers `#csvFileInput.click()` |
| `#csvFileInput`           | change    | PapaParse → validates columns → loads data → `applyFilters()` |
| `#themeToggleBtn`         | click     | Toggles `.dark-theme`, re-renders charts |
| `.tab-btn` (×5)           | click     | Shows target pane, lazy-renders charts on Tab 4 |
| `.gallery-btn` (×8)       | click     | Filters chart card visibility by `data-category` |
| `#filterDay/Time/Smoker`  | change    | `applyFilters()`                 |
| `#resetFiltersBtn`        | click     | Resets selects + `applyFilters()` |
| `#tableSearchInput`       | input     | Re-renders raw table on page 1   |
| `#prevPageBtn`            | click     | `currentPage--`, re-renders table |
| `#nextPageBtn`            | click     | `currentPage++`, re-renders table |
| `th[data-sort]` headers   | click     | Toggles sort column/direction    |
| `#billSlider / #tipSlider`| input     | `updateProbabilityLab()`         |

