### 6.4 `tips_data.js` — Embedded Dataset

Declares a global `TIPS_DATA` array of 244 JavaScript objects, each with the shape:
```js
{ total_bill: 1533.01, tip: 249.83, sex: "Male", smoker: "No", day: "Sun", time: "Dinner", size: 2 }
```
All monetary values are pre-converted to INR (USD × 83). This file is loaded before `app.js`
so it is available as a dependency.

---

### 6.5 `restaurant_analysis.py` — Python EDA Script (446 lines)

A standalone Python script that reproduces all statistical computations using pandas/NumPy
and generates the 7 chart images. Outputs to `./visualizations/`.

| Step | What it does                                              |
|------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| 1    | Loads `sns.load_dataset('tips')`, multiplies bills/tips by ₹83 |
| 2    | Prints central tendency (Mean, Median, Mode) for all 3 numeric vars |
| 3    | Prints dispersion (Range, Q1, Q2, Q3, IQR, StdDev, Variance, CV) |
| 4    | Day-wise groupby — variability table across Thur/Fri/Sat/Sun |
| 5    | Tukey IQR outlier detection for `total_bill` and `tip`    |
| 6    | Empirical probability: P(Sat), P(Bill>₹2490), P(Tip>₹415), P(Smoker), conditional P |
| 7    | Pearson correlation matrix for the 3 numeric variables    |
| 8    | Generates 7 individual PNG charts + 1 composite dashboard PNG |

#### 7 Python-Generated Charts
| #  | Filename                          | Type         | Data Mapped                                |
|----|-----------------------------------|--------------|--------------------------------------------|
| 1  | `1_histogram_total_bill.png`      | Histogram    | Frequency distribution of total_bill (15 bins), Mean+Median vlines |
| 2  | `2_scatter_bill_vs_tip.png`       | Scatter      | total_bill (x) vs tip (y), color=size, OLS trendline |
| 3  | `3_boxplot_bill_by_day.png`       | Box plot     | total_bill grouped by day (4 boxes), outliers as red circles |
| 4  | `4_line_avg_bill_by_size.png`     | Line graph   | Mean total_bill per party size (1–6), labeled data points |
| 5  | `5_bar_visits_by_day.png`         | Bar chart    | Count of visits per day (Thur/Fri/Sat/Sun) |
| 6  | `6_pie_visit_proportions.png`     | Pie chart    | Day proportion as % of 244 total visits    |
| 7  | `7_heatmap_correlation.png`       | Heatmap      | 3×3 Pearson correlation matrix (Bill/Tip/Size) |
| +  | `summary_statistical_dashboard.png` | Composite | 7-panel subplot dashboard (3×3 grid)       |

