## 13. DESIGN PRINCIPLES

- **No framework:** Pure HTML/CSS/JS — zero build step, opens directly in a browser
- **No KDE smoothing:** Histogram uses plain frequency bins as required by the mathematics syllabus
- **Reactivity:** All stats recompute on every filter change (no stale cache issues)
- **Currency localization:** All monetary values displayed in Indian numbering format (₹1,642.23)
- **Dark/light mode:** Full theme toggle with chart re-render to match text/grid colors
- **Responsive:** CSS Grid auto-fit ensures usability on different screen widths
- **SEO-compliant:** Proper `<title>`, `<meta description>`, single `<h1>`, semantic elements

